  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nWelcome to Red Passport: Ticket to Russia – an adventure game that takes you to the heart of Russia!<p></p>\n<p>Begin your journey in a cozy apartment, where the first puzzles set the stage for your epic quest. Pack your bags, head to the airport, and board a plane to a new city. But that’s just the start – an unforgettable train ride across Russia’s vast landscapes awaits, leading you to Vladivostok.</p>\n<p>Red Passport: Ticket to Russia is a journey full of discoveries, where every step brings you closer to your destination. Can you reach Vladivostok and uncover all its secrets?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Engaging Story: Unravel mysteries and stories hidden at every step of your journey.\n</li><li>Diverse Locations: From an atmospheric city apartment to a bustling airport, a plane, and an iconic train.\n</li><li>Puzzles and Challenges: Use your wits to overcome obstacles and progress.\n</li><li>Cultural Immersion: Experience Russia’s essence through detailed landscapes, sounds, and unique elements.\n</li></ul>\n",
